\* Assumption broken on purpose: the server clock runs ahead of GitHub's by more than
\* SCAN_WATERMARK_CLOCK_MARGIN_MS, so the cap does not keep the watermark out of the
\* second of the list read.
\* @...@ values are read from the code by check.sh.
SPECIFICATION Spec
CONSTANTS
    PRs = {1, 2}
    MaxTime = 2
    MaxUpdates = 2
    MaxFails = 1
    MaxHourly = 2
    Workers = 1
    StopInclusive = @StopInclusive@
    AdvanceNeedsAllSaved = @AdvanceNeedsAllSaved@
    AdvanceNeedsFullList = @AdvanceNeedsFullList@
    TargetedNeverAdvances = @TargetedNeverAdvances@
    SaveRule = @SaveRule@
    CapAtListTime = @CapAtListTime@
    ClockAhead = TRUE
    SameSecondUpdates = TRUE
    WithRepoAdd = FALSE
    WithPageRefresh = FALSE
    PartialListing = FALSE
INVARIANTS TypeOK Converged
